From f7da5687d5ae3b64c52515cb0b9381bdce1d78f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness Linux <dsh-linux@localhost>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 19:27:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(settings): add Appearance and Updates sections with
 desktop carrier bridges

Add the shell-owned Appearance section (corner-radius scale, custom CSS, and
the app-indicator toggle with symbolic/coloured artwork) and the Updates
section (rc/beta channel choice, apply button, and progress bar) below
General. Extend the dshDesktop carrier with appearance and channel/apply
update controls and red availability badges on the settings trigger and the
Updates nav cell.
